---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Navbar from '../components/Navbar.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';

const pageTitle = "Privacy Policy - Online Overtime Calculator";
const pageDescription = "Read the Privacy Policy for Online Overtime Calculator. Learn how we prioritize user privacy through client-side computations and zero storage of your salary or wage data.";
const pageKeywords = "overtime calculator privacy policy, data privacy, online overtime calculator terms, payroll data privacy";
---

<Layout
  title={pageTitle}
  description={pageDescription}
  keywords={pageKeywords}
>
  <Navbar />
  <main class="flex-1">
    <!-- Header -->
    <div class="section-container pt-8 sm:pt-12 pb-6 text-center">
      <p class="mono-eyebrow mb-2">LEGAL & PRIVACY • UPDATED 2026</p>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-semibold mb-4" style="color: var(--color-g-ink);">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-sm sm:text-base max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--color-g-body);">
        We believe your personal financial and wage information belongs exclusively to you. Learn how Online Overtime Calculator protects your privacy.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Main Content -->
    <article class="section-container pb-16">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-8">
        <!-- Quick Summary Box -->
        <div class="p-6 rounded-xl" style="background-color: var(--color-g-elevated); border: 1px solid var(--color-g-hairline);">
          <h2 class="text-base font-semibold mb-2" style="color: var(--color-g-ink);">Summary in Plain English</h2>
          <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--color-g-body);">
            <strong>Online Overtime Calculator does not store, collect, or share your earnings or hours.</strong> All overtime computations happen entirely in your local web browser. When you enter hourly rates, work hours, or view premium overtime totals, that information never leaves your device.
          </p>
        </div>

        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-semibold" style="color: var(--color-g-ink);">1. Introduction</h2>
          <p class="text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--color-g-body);">
            Welcome to Online Overtime Calculator (<span class="font-mono text-xs sm:text-sm">onlineovertimecalculator.com</span>). This Privacy Policy explains our practices regarding data privacy, how we process information when you access or use our website, and your rights concerning your personal data.
          </p>
          <p class="text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--color-g-body);">
            By visiting or using our website, you acknowledge that you have read and understood the terms of this Privacy Policy. If you do not agree with any part of this policy, please discontinue use of our site.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-semibold" style="color: var(--color-g-ink);">2. Zero Collection of Financial & Calculation Data</h2>
          <p class="text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--color-g-body);">
            Our calculators are engineered to function client-side using JavaScript. This means:
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 text-sm sm:text-base" style="color: var(--color-g-body);">
            <li>Your hourly wage, daily hours worked, weekly overtime hours, and gross pay calculations are computed in your browser memory.</li>
            <li>We do <strong>not</strong> send your financial entries to external databases or servers.</li>
            <li>We do <strong>not</strong> build profiles of individual wages, payroll records, or job roles.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-semibold" style="color: var(--color-g-ink);">3. Information We Collect Automatically</h2>
          <p class="text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--color-g-body);">
            Like standard websites on the internet, our hosting infrastructure and content delivery network (CDN) may automatically log non-personally identifiable diagnostic information to maintain site reliability, security, and uptime. This may include:
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 text-sm sm:text-base" style="color: var(--color-g-body);">
            <li><strong>Browser & Device Information:</strong> Browser type, operating system version, screen resolution, and preferred language.</li>
            <li><strong>Traffic & Usage Metrics:</strong> Approximate geographic region (country or state level), referring webpage URL, date and time stamp of requests, and pages visited.</li>
            <li><strong>IP Addresses:</strong> Processed temporarily at the network boundary for security inspection, rate limiting, and DDoS prevention.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-semibold" style="color: var(--color-g-ink);">4. Local Storage & Cookies</h2>
          <p class="text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--color-g-body);">
            Our website uses browser <span class="font-mono text-xs sm:text-sm">localStorage</span> exclusively to save your UI preferences for convenience across sessions:
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 text-sm sm:text-base" style="color: var(--color-g-body);">
            <li><strong>Dark Mode Setting:</strong> Remembers whether you prefer light or dark visual theme (<span class="font-mono text-xs">localStorage.getItem('theme')</span>).</li>
            <li><strong>State Selection:</strong> Remembers your chosen U.S. state in the calculator so you don't need to reselect it on every visit.</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--color-g-body);">
            These values reside strictly on your local browser and can be cleared at any time via your browser settings. We do not use third-party tracking cookies or advertising pixels to monitor you across other websites.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-semibold" style="color: var(--color-g-ink);">5. How We Use Collected Information</h2>
          <p class="text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--color-g-body);">
            Any technical telemetry gathered is used solely to:
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 text-sm sm:text-base" style="color: var(--color-g-body);">
            <li>Deliver, protect, and optimize website performance and loading speeds.</li>
            <li>Diagnose technical bugs, broken routes, or calculation anomalies.</li>
            <li>Defend against malicious automated attacks, spam, or denial-of-service attempts.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-semibold" style="color: var(--color-g-ink);">6. Third-Party Services</h2>
          <p class="text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--color-g-body);">
            We may use trusted third-party providers (such as hosting networks, font CDNs like Google Fonts, and security firewalls) to serve static assets securely and rapidly. These entities process metadata in accordance with their respective industry-standard privacy and security policies.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-semibold" style="color: var(--color-g-ink);">7. California Consumer Privacy Act (CCPA/CPRA) & GDPR</h2>
          <p class="text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--color-g-body);">
            We respect the privacy rights of all users, including residents of California and the European Economic Area:
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 text-sm sm:text-base" style="color: var(--color-g-body);">
            <li><strong>Right to Know & Access:</strong> You may request confirmation of what data we possess. Because we do not require account registration or store payroll inputs, we do not link calculation inputs to your identity.</li>
            <li><strong>Right to Deletion:</strong> You have the right to request deletion of any personal data you have directly provided to us (e.g., via contact emails).</li>
            <li><strong>No Sale or Sharing of Data:</strong> We do not sell, rent, or monetize your personal information to third parties or data brokers.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-semibold" style="color: var(--color-g-ink);">8. Children's Privacy (COPPA)</h2>
          <p class="text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--color-g-body);">
            Our service is designed for employees, employers, and general adults requiring overtime pay calculations. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children under the age of 13.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-semibold" style="color: var(--color-g-ink);">9. Changes to This Policy</h2>
          <p class="text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--color-g-body);">
            We may update this Privacy Policy periodically to reflect enhancements to our tool or changes in applicable legal statutes. When modifications are made, the "Updated 2026" date at the top will be refreshed. Continued use of the website following any update signifies your agreement to the revised policy.
          </p>
        </section>

        <!-- Contact Section -->
        <section class="p-6 rounded-xl" style="background-color: var(--color-g-elevated); border: 1px solid var(--color-g-hairline);">
          <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-2" style="color: var(--color-g-ink);">10. Contact Us About Privacy</h2>
          <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4" style="color: var(--color-g-body);">
            If you have questions, comments, or data requests regarding this Privacy Policy, please contact our privacy team directly:
          </p>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <span class="text-xs mono-eyebrow">Email:</span>
            <a href="mailto:hello@onlineovertimecalculator.com" class="font-mono text-sm sm:text-base font-medium underline" style="color: var(--color-g-link);">
              hello@onlineovertimecalculator.com
            </a>
          </div>
        </section>
      </div>
    </article>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>
